## 🔧 Redis Setup (Optional but Recommended)

### Install Redis

**macOS:**
```bash
brew install redis
brew services start redis
```

**Ubuntu:**
```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt install redis-server
sudo systemctl start redis
```

**Windows:**
Download from [Redis Windows](https://github.com/microsoftarchive/redis/releases)

### Test Redis

```bash
redis-cli ping
# Should return: PONG
```

